<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Create beautiful plinths to display artifacts and important colony goods.-->
  <VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.description>美观的底座才配得上所展示的文物、艺术品和贵重商品。</VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.description>
  <VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->showcasing splendor-->
    <li>subject-&gt;华丽展览</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted exquisite displays, elevating the presentation of artifacts beyond mere possession to celebration-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心打造了展览台，让神器和圣物的呈现演变为庆祝</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->enhanced the allure of treasures, creating spaces where culture and curiosity converge-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;提高了秘宝的诱惑力，创造出文化与求知交融的空间</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->curating collections to kindle wonder and wisdom-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;策展藏品以激起惊叹与智慧</li>
  </VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: artful display-->
  <VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.label>精巧展览台</VFE_Res_ArtfulDisplay.label>
  <!--EN: Adapt advanced display techniques to showcase three-dimensional models around your colony.-->
  <VFE_Res_Holograms.description>深入研习先进的展映技术，解锁制作能在殖民地中投射三维模型的「全息底座」。</VFE_Res_Holograms.description>
  <VFE_Res_Holograms.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->illuminating innovation-->
    <li>subject-&gt;启发革新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->harnessed light to give form to the formless, creating holograms that challenge the confines of reality-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用光将无形之物变为有形，创造出冲击现实界限的全息影像</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->brought to life the marvels of the cosmos and the intricacies of imagination in vivid display-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;使宇宙的奇妙和复杂的想象力栩栩如生地呈现在眼前</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->casting dreams into the daylight, where thoughts take tangible shape-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;使梦想投射于光中，令其得以化形</li>
  </VFE_Res_Holograms.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: holograms-->
  <VFE_Res_Holograms.label>全息影像</VFE_Res_Holograms.label>
  <!--EN: Create massive monuments, centerpieces of your colony, to commemorate those who passed and give inspiration to those still struggling.-->
  <VFE_Res_Monuments.description>解锁雕刻可作为殖民地地标的巨型「纪念碑」，以纪念逝者并为仍在挣扎中的人们提供激励。</VFE_Res_Monuments.description>
  <VFE_Res_Monuments.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->testaments of time-->
    <li>subject-&gt;历史存证</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->erected grand monuments, each a story of survival, achievement, and loss-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;筑起了记载有生存、所得与所失的故事的宏伟纪念碑</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->cemented their tales in the bedrock of civilization, inspiring all who gaze upon them-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将他们的传说刻印在文明基石之上，鼓舞所有驻足观望它的人</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->crafting the pillars of history and hope-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;建造代表历史与希望的支撑柱</li>
  </VFE_Res_Monuments.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: monuments-->
  <VFE_Res_Monuments.label>纪念碑</VFE_Res_Monuments.label>
  <!--EN: Learn how to sculpt tall, narrow shaped obelisks to commemorate important events.-->
  <VFE_Res_Obelisk.description>解锁雕刻用于纪念重大事件的高窄「方尖碑」。</VFE_Res_Obelisk.description>
  <VFE_Res_Obelisk.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->stone sentinels of history-->
    <li>subject-&gt;历史石卫</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the art of carving stone into towering obelisks, symbols of significant achievements and memory-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精通将岩石雕刻为矗立方尖碑的技艺，是重大成就和记忆的象征</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->marked the landscape with these monoliths, guiding future generations towards understanding their heritage-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为指引子孙后代了解遗产，用这些巨石标记了景色风貌</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->etching the narrative of civilization into the earth itself-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将文明的故事雕刻至大地之上</li>
  </VFE_Res_Obelisk.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: obelisks-->
  <VFE_Res_Obelisk.label>方尖碑</VFE_Res_Obelisk.label>
  <!--EN: Learn how to create beautiful vases and other vessels from simple materials.-->
  <VFE_Res_Pottery.description>研习如何用简单的材料制作漂亮的花瓶和其他器皿。</VFE_Res_Pottery.description>
  <VFE_Res_Pottery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the clay canvas-->
    <li>subject-&gt;黏土艺术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->rediscovered ancient techniques for shaping clay into vessels of beauty and utility-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重新找到了将黏土塑形为漂亮且实用的容器的远古技术</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->elevated simple materials to art, capturing the essence of culture in each curve and color-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将简易材料升华为艺术，捕获每条弧线和每种颜色中蕴藏的文化本质</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->molding the earth's bounty into forms of lasting legacy-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将大地的予赠化为长久存在的遗物</li>
  </VFE_Res_Pottery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: pottery-->
  <VFE_Res_Pottery.label>陶器</VFE_Res_Pottery.label>
  <!--EN: Learn how to create beautiful rugs to decorate your colony.-->
  <VFE_Res_Rugs.description>研习用地毯装饰殖民地的艺术。</VFE_Res_Rugs.description>
  <VFE_Res_Rugs.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->weaving warmth and wonder-->
    <li>subject-&gt;编织温暖与惊异</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->interlaced threads of diverse origins into rugs, each a masterpiece of color and comfort-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将来源各异的丝线纺成地毯，每块都是体现了色彩与舒适的杰作</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->spread the fabric of their culture underfoot, a soft foundation for everyday life and luxury-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;传播作为根本的文化织物，它是日常生活和奢华享受的柔软基础</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->laying down the tapestries of tales untold-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;铺设记载着未知传说的壁毯</li>
  </VFE_Res_Rugs.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: rugs-->
  <VFE_Res_Rugs.label>地毯</VFE_Res_Rugs.label>
  <!--EN: Sculpt accurate character-shaped sculptures, inscribed with artistic illustrations.-->
  <VFE_Res_Statues.description>解锁雕刻栩栩如生的人物雕像。</VFE_Res_Statues.description>
  <VFE_Res_Statues.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the form of remembrance-->
    <li>subject-&gt;有形纪念</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->sculpted figures from marble and stone, capturing the spirit of those who shaped their world-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用大理石和山岩雕刻人像，捕获那些世界塑造者们的灵魂</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->populated their halls and plazas with the likenesses of the revered, making every glance a lesson in legacy-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;他们人山人海的大厅与露天广场上摆满了名人的雕像，使每一瞥都化作旧时一课</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->freezing moments of greatness in stone for eternity-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;封存在永恒之石上的伟大时刻</li>
  </VFE_Res_Statues.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: statues-->
  <VFE_Res_Statues.label>雕像</VFE_Res_Statues.label>
  <!--EN: Master the techniques of wall carving to create beautiful pillars and reliefs.-->
  <VFE_Res_WallCarvings.description>大师级的雕刻技术，能创造美丽的柱体和墙面浮雕。</VFE_Res_WallCarvings.description>
  <VFE_Res_WallCarvings.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->narratives in stone-->
    <li>subject-&gt;石之故事</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->carved tales of triumph and tragedy into the very walls that sheltered them-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将悲喜之故事雕刻于保护他们的高耸墙体上</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->turned blank stone canvases into epic visual stories, immortalizing heroes and history-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在空白的石之画布上绘下宏大的视觉故事，让英雄与历史永垂不朽</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->breathing life into stone with tales of old and new-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用新旧故事将生活注入岩石中</li>
  </VFE_Res_WallCarvings.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: carvings-->
  <VFE_Res_WallCarvings.label>雕刻</VFE_Res_WallCarvings.label>
  <!--EN: Construct beautiful walls covered in wallpaper of your desired colour.-->
  <VFE_Res_Wallpapers.description>解锁建造色彩丰富的墙纸。</VFE_Res_Wallpapers.description>
  <VFE_Res_Wallpapers.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the texture of times-->
    <li>subject-&gt;时间材质</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->adorned their walls with wallpapers, each pattern a reflection of the era’s aesthetic and ethos-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用壁纸粉饰他们的墙体，其中的每种图案都反映了时代的美学与风气</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed living spaces into canvases of personal and collective expression-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将居所转变为个人与群体直抒胸臆的画布</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->clothing walls in the vestments of vision and vibrancy-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将墙体包裹在想象与活力的法衣中</li>
  </VFE_Res_Wallpapers.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: wallpapers-->
  <VFE_Res_Wallpapers.label>壁纸</VFE_Res_Wallpapers.label>
</LanguageData>
